  "result": "Perfect! All 286 tests pass. The foreign currency support is complete. Here's what I added:\n\n**Updated `src/errors.js`:**\n- Added `UNKNOWN_CURRENCY` error code for unsupported currencies\n\n**Updated `src/money.js` with:**\n\n**`RATES` constant:**\n- EUR: 1 (base currency)\n- USD: 1.085 (units of USD per EUR)\n- GBP: 0.8425 (units of GBP per EUR)\n\n**`convert(cents, currency)`** function:\n- Converts EUR cents to specified currency's cents\n- Formula: `Math.round(eur_cents * RATES[currency])`\n- Returns `ok(converted_cents)` or `fail('UNKNOWN_CURRENCY')`\n- Handles EUR, USD, GBP conversions\n- Works with negative amounts and zero\n\n**`formatMoney(cents, currency)`** function:\n- Formats money with currency symbol and 2 decimal places\n- Uses \u20ac for EUR, $ for USD, \u00a3 for GBP\n- Includes thousands separators (1,234.56)\n- Handles negative amounts with leading minus sign\n- Works exactly like formatEuros but with different symbols\n\n**Added 22 comprehensive tests covering:**\n- RATES constant values\n- Currency conversion accuracy (EUR\u2192USD, EUR\u2192GBP, EUR\u2192EUR)\n- Rounding behavior in conversions\n- Unknown currency error handling\n- Negative amounts and zero\n- Symbol selection for each currency\n- Thousands separators\n- Decimal formatting\n- Conversions followed by formatting\n- End-to-end workflows\n\n**Test results:** 286 passing (including 22 new currency tests).",
